Luke 19:1 , Of Zacchaeus a publican;
Luke 19:11 , The ten pieces of money;
Luke 19:28 , Christ rides into Jerusalem with triumph;
Luke 19:41 , weeps over it;
Luke 19:45 , drives the buyers and sellers out of the temple;
Luke 19:47 , teaching daily in it. The rulers seek to destroy him, but fear the people.
